@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title AI - Search Products with AI Assistant

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Guest|
start
note right
Precondition:
Guest is not authenticated.

Postcondition:
None.
end note
:Open the AI assistant function;
|System|
:Display the question input;
|Guest|
:Enter a question about public products;
:Submit the question;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Guest|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
if (The assistant can answer the question?) then (No)
  :Return the cannot-answer notice;
  |Guest|
  :View the cannot-answer notice;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif
|System|
:Find the relevant information and generate the answer;
:Display the answer;
|Guest|
:View the answer;
stop

@enduml
